{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Wireframe inner system and take control of your very own physics based racing vehicle!\u00a0<br><br>In this latest installment of the Wireframe series, you will be drifting, spinning and falling on tracks set within the Wireframe world's inner system. In the inner system, there are less threats and more of an economy, so the inhabitants of the Inner System spend their time racing and competing to see who is the fastest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join in start your own collection of vehicles with visual and mechanical customization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the physics system which was based on real world physics, with some stylish concessions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your own garage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'll see you at the Races, User!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946160?t=1768363124","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946160?t=1768363124","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946160/5380847e7511bac2854dc7f5f05a9ffd6bcff72f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768363124","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946160/5380847e7511bac2854dc7f5f05a9ffd6bcff72f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768363124","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Wireframe inner system and take control of your very own physics based racing vehicle!\u00a0<br><br>In th